            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/dw559kr7002#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Pencil, four figures without separators, read from the lower panel; taken as day, month, two-figure year on the pattern of the other undivided dates in the corpus. The second figure has a closed upper loop and crossing strokes, so it is an 8 and not a 6; the first and third are the same 2."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
